        "category": "plugin",
        "severity": "warning",
        "description": "Make the wrapped operation explicit in the Effect pipeline. A generic Effect.sync callback hides the call's role among the other steps. Use Effect log functions for logs and give updates or other operations a clear pipeline step. Preserve deferred execution and failure behavior through the rewrite.",
